      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, that\u0027s a good point about the R/M/W possible conflict and bd9995x_select_input_port() gets called early enough w.r.t USB_SUS being cleared. The one issue i see with checking the battery voltage here, is that this only gets called once per connection, so potentially VSYS_PRIORITY wont\u0027 get cleared until the connection is removed (if I\u0027m understanding it correctly)",
